 12pt;\"><strong>3. 소요시간:</strong></span> 1인당 약 30분 소요 (조별 면접)</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">​</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4. 장소:</strong></span> 든사람교육센터(도서관 211호)</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5. 신청기간:</strong></span> <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2019.08.23.(금) ~ 09.02.(월) 18:00 </strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">​</span><br></p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>6. 신청방법: </strong></span><strong>&nbsp;취업지원본부 홈페이지(원스톱 ID 로그인) -&gt; 상단 메뉴 취업/교육 프로그램(클릭) -&gt; <a href=\"http://job.kumoh.ac.kr/kit/admin/jprog/view.jsp?Idx=746\"><font color=\"black\">2019년 구직자 잡(job)클리닉 모의면접컨설팅</font></a> 클릭 </strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&gt; 우측 하단 참가신청 클릭 -&gt; 보내기 클릭</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Thread-00003610-Id-0000002a\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 홈페이지 주소 : <a href=\"http://job.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><u>http://job.kumoh.ac.kr</u></a></font></strong></span></font></span></p></span><p><br></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>7. 제출서류:</strong></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">1)&nbsp; 이력서 및 자기소개서</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2)&nbsp; 신분증 사본&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3)&nbsp; 개인정보 수집이용동의서 (첨부파일)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">​</span>&nbsp;